        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NUCLEAR BOMBS! GHOSTS! FUTURISTIC MACHINES! And of course... PIZZA!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver all kinds of crazy packages in <strong>Birbox</strong>, a 2D puzzle-platformer where you play as a regular bird with a very irregular job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every package is a new delivery experience!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At <strong>Birbox Inc.</strong>, deliveries are... let’s say <i>extravagant</i>. That’s why each level introduces a new mechanic to master — from umbrellas to teksaballs!<br>Wait… you don’t know what a teksaball is?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/e049e9ce1f820f774a61c2ea7efad59b.poster.avif?t=1758860243\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/e049e9ce1f820f774a61c2ea7efad59b.webm?t=1758860243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/e049e9ce1f820f774a61c2ea7efad59b.mp4?t=1758860243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Think outside the box... and with the box itself!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These deliveries won’t be easy. You’ll need to use <strong>physics</strong> and the <strong>unique properties</strong> of each package to solve <strong>puzzles</strong> that require timing, skill, and the cleverness of a crow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/37776eac72a6d7b08bb8d30e2619e662.poster.avif?t=1758860243\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/37776eac72a6d7b08bb8d30e2619e662.webm?t=1758860243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/37776eac72a6d7b08bb8d30e2619e662.mp4?t=1758860243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete with the competition — literally!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, did we mention the deadly robots? Between puzzles, you’ll face <strong>enemies</strong> that spice up your delivery routes.<br>You’ll also encounter <i><strong>bosses</strong></i> who want to stop those boxes from reaching their destination.<br>They’re not just tough — they’re puzzles too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/84a4174370e48ecafe09e15a525aa8cf.poster.avif?t=1758860243\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/84a4174370e48ecafe09e15a525aa8cf.webm?t=1758860243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/84a4174370e48ecafe09e15a525aa8cf.mp4?t=1758860243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Too easy for you? Go for five stars!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our clients demand <i>speed</i>. So if you’re up for a challenge, try to complete each delivery <strong>as quickly as possible</strong> to earn a five-star rating.<br>(Who knows — it might come in handy later…)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or maybe you'd prefer a more careful approach? Try finishing levels <strong>without damaging the package</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go for perfection or take it easy — the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/0c2699907e0846abf6a8cbba8ec2b2ab.poster.avif?t=1758860243\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/0c2699907e0846abf6a8cbba8ec2b2ab.webm?t=1758860243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/0c2699907e0846abf6a8cbba8ec2b2ab.mp4?t=1758860243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chat with unforgettable clients!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this bird-filled world, every customer is unique. Before each delivery, you'll have a chance to <strong>talk with your clients</strong> — no matter how big, old… or clueless they might be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/a6b4c32789f6f322b3bede4a4843e19c.poster.avif?t=1758860243\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/a6b4c32789f6f322b3bede4a4843e19c.webm?t=1758860243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/a6b4c32789f6f322b3bede4a4843e19c.mp4?t=1758860243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Birbox — for free!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s the only delivery job where you’ll handle rockets, radioactive materials, and... a <i>ton</i> of fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/b64a8b7645984107aca09b54ce0fb5ac.poster.avif?t=1758860243\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/b64a8b7645984107aca09b54ce0fb5ac.webm?t=1758860243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002780/extras/b64a8b7645984107aca09b54ce0fb5ac.mp4?t=1758860243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
